What:		/sys/kernel/tracing/events/gpu_mem/gpu_mem_total
Date:		September 2026
Description:
		Android GPU-memory accounting tracepoint consumed by GpuService's
		gpuMem eBPF program. The tracepoint reports the current total rather
		than an allocation delta.

		The raw event fields, after the common trace header, are:

		  u32 gpu_id
		  u32 pid
		  u64 size

		A pid of zero reports the device-wide total. A positive pid reports
		the total GPU-addressable virtual memory mapped by that process. A
		size of zero causes the Android eBPF program to remove the associated
		map entry.

		KGSL emits process-total updates after successful pagetable map and
		unmap operations. It emits device-total updates for allocations,
		frees, sparse mappings, and imported dma-bufs. Multiple imports of
		the same dma-buf count only once in the device total.
